s-new-standard-for-ethereum-alignment"}],"entity":"Linea Association; Consensys bootstrapped the network and retains a disclosed token allocation","key_events":[{"date":"2024-11-13","type":"formation","description":"The Swiss nonprofit Linea Association was created.","source_url":"https://linea.build/blog/updated-introducing-the-linea-association-a-major-step-toward-network-decentralization"},{"date":"2025-09-10","type":"governance","description":"The LINEA token launched after a delayed decentralization process.","source_url":"https://linea.build/blog/42-days-of-linea-token-where-weve-been-where-were-going"}],"regulatory_status":null},"narrative":{"as_of":"2026-07-29","purpose":"Ethereum-equivalent zero-knowledge rollup execution for applications and onchain capital.","positioning":"An ETH-aligned zkEVM that pays gas in ETH and burns both ETH and LINEA from protocol economics.","competitors":[{"name":"zkSync Era","relationship":"zkEVM ecosystem competitor"},{"name":"Scroll","relationship":"Ethereum-aligned zk rollup competitor"},{"name":"Base","relationship":"corporate-distributed Ethereum L2 competitor"}],"narrative_arc":"Consensys launched Linea through MetaMask-linked distribution, formed a Swiss association, delayed the token, then launched an ecosystem-heavy token model and ETH-aligned burn thesis.","media_sentiment":"mixed"},"risk":{"as_of":"2026-07-29","exploits":[],"sanctions":{"flagged":false,"detail":"No base-chain designation is recorded here; applications and addresses require separate screening."},"extraction_flags":["centralized_sequencer","upgrade_keys","corporate_distribution","bridge_dependency"],"audit_status":"Multiple protocol audits and a public bug bounty exist; L2BEAT documents remaining sequencing, proving, and upgrade trust assumptions.","risks":[{"type":"control","detail":"Sequencing and upgrade controls can censor, halt, or change the system before full decentralization."},{"type":"bridge_and_prover","detail":"Canonical bridging and proof-system faults can impair exits or invalidate security assumptions."},{"type":"capital_retention","detail":"TVL has fallen more than 98 percent from the incentive-era peak, indicating weak retained capital."}]},"synthesis":{"as_of":"2026-07-29","situation":"Linea retains a functioning zkEVM and recognizable distribution, but TVL is roughly $27.5 million—98.4 percent below its September 2025 peak—and LINEA is about 95 percent below launch-day high.","postmortem":null,"why":"MetaMask and Consensys distribution created rapid reach, while EVM equivalence reduced porting cost. Incentive-driven capital proved transient, and late token launch did not by itself create durable liquidity.","strategic_choices":[{"decision":"Optimize for EVM equivalence and Consensys product distribution.","consequence":"Developer and wallet onboarding improved while corporate control perceptions persisted.","confidence":"high","source_refs":["https://linea.build/blog/linea-completes-its-alpha-mainnet-launch"]},{"decision":"Delay the token until after mainnet and Association formation.","consequence":"The chain established usage without a token, but the delayed TGE accumulated expectations and timing risk.","confidence":"high","source_refs":["https://linea.build/blog/updated-introducing-the-linea-association-a-major-step-toward-network-decentralization","https://linea.build/blog/42-days-of-linea-token-where-weve-been-where-were-going"]},{"decision":"Keep ETH as gas and burn both ETH and LINEA.","consequence":"The model strengthens Ethereum alignment but makes direct LINEA value capture dependent on fee volume and implementation.","confidence":"high","source_refs":["https://linea.build/blog/linea-sets-new-standard-for-ethereum-alignment"]}],"lessons_learned":["Wallet distribution can acquire users faster than it retains capital.","A late token launch must be modeled separately from chain launch.","ETH alignment and native-token value capture can coexist but require explicit fee routing."],"could_differ":"An earlier token may have accelerated governance but also could have intensified mercenary incentives before the network''s institutional and technical foundations matured.","unknowns":["How much of the 2025 TVL peak was incentive-sensitive?","When will sequencing and proving reach the next decentralization stage?","What are realized versus announced dual-burn totals?","How concentrated are voting and Consortium allocation controls?"],"outlook":{"bull":"Native yield and Ethereum alignment rebuild sticky capital.","base":"Linea remains a technically credible but smaller zkEVM under intense L2 competition.","bear":"Capital fails to return and corporate-control concerns limit differentiation.","most_likely":"base"},"cause_tags":["corporate_distribution","evm_equivalence","late_token_launch","incentive_unwind"],"confidence":"high"}},"meta":{"dimension_completeness_pct":100,"data_completeness_pct":86,"confidence":"high","unsourced_fields":["capital.total_raised_usd","capital.treasury_usd","token.unlock_overhang_pct","onchain.revenue_30d_usd","onchain.active_addresses_daily","onchain.dev_activity_monthly","onchain.tvl_concentration","team.regulatory_status"],"last_reviewed":"2026-07-29"}},{"chain":"Dexalot","source_catalog":{"intro":{"title":"Dexalot L1 introduction","url":"https://docs.dexalot.com/en/articles/subnet/"},"about":{"title":"About Dexalot","url":"https://dexalot.com/en/about"},"litepaper":{"title":"Dexalot litepaper","url":"https://dexalot.com/docs/DEXALOT-Litepaper.pdf"},"token":{"title":"CoinGecko Dexalot market data API","url":"https://api.coingecko.com/api/v3/coins/dexalot"},"tvl":{"title":"DefiLlama Dexalot historical TVL API","url":"https://api.llama.fi/v2/historicalChainTvl/Dexalot"},"fees":{"title":"DefiLlama Dexalot fees API","url":"https://api.llama.fi/overview/fees/Dexalot?dataType=dailyFees"},"volume":{"title":"DefiLlama Dexalot DEX volume API","url":"https://api.llama.fi/overview/dexs/Dexalot?dataType=dailyVolume"},"avalanche":{"title":